  "details": "Any avatar will clip behind the Main Menu, when spinning on its turntable in preview mode.\n\nSeverity: Urgent\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Open the Main Menu\n\n2. Open the Avatar menu\n\n3. Select any avatar\n\n4. You may not see a preview, because it is obscured by the Main Menu.\n\nLonger appendages may clip through the front, but essentially, the positioning of the avatar turntable needs to be placed back in front of the menu again.",
